    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d198">

                <pb facs="0410" n="364" xml:id="pg364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/2148½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">19 June, 1918</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: This despatch has
                    interested me very much. These associations may be of very great service as
                    instruments for what we are now planning to do in Siberia.</p>
                <p>By the way, I saw Professor Masaryk today and he seemed to think well of the
                    plan.</p>
                <p>Faithfully Yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. W.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
